{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>Blackmores腸道益生菌300億30粒裝（Blackmores Probiotics+ Daily Health）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及莎莎共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單瓶標價計，最低與次低相差HK$144，約48%。</p>\n<h2>Blackmores腸道益生菌300億30粒裝｜單瓶網店價一覽</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜莎莎</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$155</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$155</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單瓶標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$299</td>\n<td>HK$299</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$299</td>\n<td>HK$299</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Blackmores腸道益生菌300億30粒裝｜選購與包裝</h2>\n<p>買一瓶的話，莎莎列出HK$155，較表列次低標價HK$299少HK$144。莎莎報價以單瓶商品標價計。選購時可核對300億及30粒規格，再比較送貨門檻及取貨方式。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月19日商戶網上報價。價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源<a href=\"https://www.sasa.com.hk/SalePage/Index/538091\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">莎莎</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/blackmores-probiotics-daily-health-30pcs/p/584540\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/blackmores-%E8%85%B8%E9%81%93%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%9F%E8%8F%8C300%E5%84%84/p/BP_264304\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a></p>\n<p>Blackmores香港列出五種益生菌及菊糖。研究觀察到的益生菌作用會因菌株、用量及研究用途而異。如對成分或服用有疑問，可先請教醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。資料來源<a href=\"https://www.blackmores.com.hk/zh-hk/products/probiotics-daily-health\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blackmores香港產品資料</a><a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Probiotics-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS 益生菌資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（HK$299－HK$155）÷HK$299×100%，約48%。以上為表列同規格單瓶標價的比較，未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179502701145378798_14131978276afdf04580f96.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blackmores腸道益生菌300億30粒裝｜莎莎 HK$155，同款單瓶價差約48%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179502701145378798_14131978276afdf04580f96.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較規格為每瓶30粒。購買前請核對實物標籤、包裝及商戶條款。</p>\n<p>這款益生菌需要冷藏嗎？<i></i></p>\n<p>Blackmores香港產品頁列明此配方無需冷藏。開封後應依照實物標籤的儲存指示。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T18:44:31.891047+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":716,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:36:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:25:13.830008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T18:38:01.011927+00:00","content_hash":"ee3d0ced1cda800ae608379e0d97f1165503d22846019c76261c9b00e63b34a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}